# After Case of the Locked Hothouse solves, its top-library permission lets Bot1 cast creature spells for their mana costs.
# Bolas's Citadel also permits the top spell for life equal to its mana value. On Bot2's turn, Cathar Commando has flash;
# Case supplies the {1}{W} route and Citadel supplies a separate life route.
# Rules: CR 601.3, 601.2b and 118.9; each cast uses an applicable permission and the cost attached to that route.
# Sources: https://magic.wizards.com/en/rules ; https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/feature/murders-at-karlov-manor-release-notes

